Scope of this licence

This licence covers the source code, notebooks, documentation and the tables
and figures produced by this code. It does not cover:

- the competition data (Capella SAR scenes, plot and village shapefiles, the
  host's templates), which are not included and remain under the terms of the
  ANRF AISEHack 2.0 competitions on Kaggle;
- the third-party tables in phase3_yield_forecast/data_aux/inherited/
  (consensus.csv and orion_feat.csv), which come from other teams' public
  competition submissions and remain the work of their authors;
- published statistics and open datasets referenced or summarised here
  (Directorate of Agriculture, Gujarat; data.gov.in; Google Dynamic World;
  ESA WorldCover and WorldCereal; Copernicus Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2;
  ERA5-Land), which remain under their own licences.
